---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Septic System Design La Paz County AZ | Diaz Environmental LLC"
  description="ADEQ-certified septic design and percolation testing in La Paz County AZ. Serving Parker, Quartzsite, Salome, Wenden & surrounding areas. Call (602) 812-8609."
  canonical="https://diazenviroaz.com/septic-la-paz-county"
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Septic System Services in La Paz County, AZ</h1>
      <p>Expert ADEQ-certified septic design and percolation testing in La Paz County. Serving Parker, Quartzsite, Salome, Wenden and all surrounding communities.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>
    <section class="service-body">
      <h2>Septic Systems in La Paz County</h2>
      <p>La Paz County is one of Arizona's most rural counties, stretching along the Colorado River from Parker in the north to Quartzsite in the south. With the exception of a few small communities, virtually all properties in La Paz County depend on onsite wastewater treatment systems. If you're building, buying, or selling property in La Paz County, a properly permitted septic system is a requirement.</p>

      <h2>Communities We Serve in La Paz County</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Parker</li>
        <li>Quartzsite</li>
        <li>Salome</li>
        <li>Wenden</li>
        <li>Congress</li>
        <li>Bouse</li>
        <li>Brenda</li>
        <li>Ehrenberg</li>
        <li>La Paz Valley</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Desert Soil Expertise</h2>
      <p>La Paz County's sandy and gravelly desert soils present unique percolation characteristics. Our team understands how to properly test and design systems for these conditions, ensuring your ADEQ permit is based on accurate, site-specific data.</p>

      <h2>Servicios Sépticos en el Condado de La Paz</h2>
      <p>Diaz Environmental ofrece diseño de sistemas sépticos certificados por ADEQ, pruebas de percolación y gestión de permisos en todo el Condado de La Paz, incluyendo Parker, Quartzsite, Salome, Wenden y más. ¡Hablamos español y ofrecemos consultas gratuitas!</p>
    </section>
    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Serving All of La Paz County, AZ</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:6028128609">(602) 812-8609</a> — free consultation, same day response.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Contact Us Today</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  .service-page { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
  .service-hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .service-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-body h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #154a2a; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  .service-body p { color: #444; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-body ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .service-body ul li { padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.5rem; position: relative; color: #444; }
  .service-body ul li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .service-cta { text-align: center; background: #f0f7f2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 3rem 2rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .service-cta h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-cta p { color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] { color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; background: #154a2a; color: white; padding: 13px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.3s; }
  .btn:hover { background: #0d3019; }
</style>